{"articleNo":"572135","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=572135&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 「2026 경상북도 대학(원)생 일본문화 연수 프로그램」 참가자 모집 안내","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2026.07.30","hit":"10191","attachments":[{"name":"1. 모집요강.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=572135&attachNo=166810"},{"name":"2. 홈비지트 신청서.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=572135&attachNo=166811"},{"name":"3. 참가자 명부 (1).hwpx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=572135&attachNo=166812"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">경상북도와 자매결연 지역인 일본 히로시마현에서 일본 및 히로시마현에 대한  이해를 높이고 국제적 감각을 갖춘 글로벌 인재를 양성하기 위하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, 2027. 2. 3.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">∼ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2.10.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">일정으로 </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2026 </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">경상북도 대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">생 일본문화 연수 프로그램</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">을 운영한다고 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">이와 관련</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">도내 대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">명을 모집하고자 하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, 우리</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;대학에서는 학생들의&nbsp;적극 참여 바라며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">붙임의 모집요강을 참고하시어 <b><u><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">참가자 명부</span></u></b></span><b><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">홈비지트 신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">일본어능력시험 증명서를 첨부하여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2026. 9.23(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">까지 전자우편</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(bumhyun@korea.kr)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">으로 직접 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.</span></u></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">※ </span><u><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">참가자 확정은 참가동기 및 어학수준 등을 감안하여 결정</span></u></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">붙임  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">참가자 모집요강 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">홈비지트 신청서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">참가자 명부 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;ms